
standard commands to build unix.

> ../configure --prefix=TCL_INSTALLED_DIRECTORY --enable-stubs --with-oracle-directory=$ORACLE_HOME
> make
> make install

some linux users have reported that the Makefile needs a little tweak in
order to compile oratcl with ActiveTcl distributed by ActiveState.
Thanks to Jeremy Collins for the hint.

In the Makefile replace:

  -rpath ${LIB_RUNTIME_DIR}

With:

  -Wl,-rpath,${LIB_RUNTIME_DIR}

